    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\sqrt{2}\\times\\sqrt[3]{3}<\\sqrt{3}\\times\\sqrt[3]{2}$\n\nCompare their sixth powers, $72$ and $108$.",
      "worked": "The sixth power is increasing for positive numbers. Both products are positive.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\left(\\sqrt2\\times\\sqrt[3]3\\right)^6&=2^3\\times3^2\\\\\n\\left(\\sqrt2\\times\\sqrt[3]3\\right)^6&=72\\\\\n\\left(\\sqrt3\\times\\sqrt[3]2\\right)^6&=3^3\\times2^2\\\\\n\\left(\\sqrt3\\times\\sqrt[3]2\\right)^6&=108\n\\end{align*}$$\nSince $72<108$, $\\sqrt2\\times\\sqrt[3]3<\\sqrt3\\times\\sqrt[3]2$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
